haroff="50">338&#x000b1;168</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">213047</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">SET translocation (myeloid leukaemia-associated)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">SET</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x000b1;" charoff="50">1351&#x000b1;298</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x000b1;" charoff="50">478&#x000b1;201</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">209048</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Protein kinase C-binding protein 1</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">PRKCBPI</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x000b1;" charoff="50">294&#x000b1;113</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x000b1;" charoff="50">158&#x000b1;79</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote7"><label>a</label><p>Array signal are median signal intensity values&#x000b1;standard deviation.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>